1. Familiarize yourself with FHIR's API, data types, and conformance notes (e.g., [FHIR R4](https://www.hl7.org/fhir/r4/)) before implementing this code example.
2. Consider using a Java-based library like FHIR-Validator (Java) or fhir-validator (Node.js) to simplify the validation process.

