2. Parse the incoming message (HL7v2) to extract the necessary information.
3. Perform the database query to retrieve patient details based on the provided MRN.
4. Log the search parameters for debugging and auditing purposes.

Below is a complete Mirth Connect script that fulfills this request:

```javascript
// Define an HTTP Listener connector to receive incoming requests

function handleIncomingMessage(message) {
