2. **Exponential Backoff and Circuit Breaker Logic**:
   - If this is the first attempt (`attemptCount < maxRetries`), it will retry the operation.
   - If all retries have failed, it will log the error to `/path/to/logfile.log`.

3. **Logging Errors**:
