4. We check if this is a duplicate message by checking if there are any previous messages with the same value for the `MSH-10` field (using the `hasPreviousMessageWithSameMsh10()` method). If not, we allow it to pass through (`return true`). Otherwise, we drop the duplicate and log an informative error message (`log.info()`) before rejecting the message (`return false; // reject the message`).
